      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\(\\boxed{\\frac{1}{6}}\\) There are 3, 2, 1 outcomes with sum 10, 11, 12, so the probability is \\(\\frac{3+2+1}{6^2}=\\frac{1}{6}\\).",
